This product includes PII detection patterns derived from Microsoft Presidio
(maisecrets/rules/presidio.json: regexes, scores and context words of its
pattern recognizers), Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation, MIT License (see
maisecrets/rules/LICENSE-presidio). The checksum validators for the generic
and German entities in maisecrets/detect.py are ports of Presidio's, verified
by scripts/check_validators_against_presidio.py.

The remaining PII and positional rules in maisecrets/detect.py (OWN_RULES) are plain
regular expressions written for this project; some shapes match the ones the
phase6 ai-gateway scrubber uses, because both were written by the same people
for the same data.
